  "annotations": [
    { "id": "note-1", "page": "page-1", "x": 0, "y": -150, "w": 520, "text": "CORE JOURNEY — read left to right, top to bottom.\nHome → Confirm → Matchmaking → Match Found → Chat → Prompts → End Chat → Post-Shit." },
    { "id": "note-2", "page": "page-1", "x": 1880, "y": 0, "w": 300, "text": "Direction A — “Deadpan Dark”.\nWarm near-black, porcelain type, one acid-lime accent, mono for anything numeric. The joke lives in the copy; the UI plays it completely straight.\n\nType: Bricolage Grotesque (display) · Space Grotesk (UI) · JetBrains Mono (timers, IDs, labels)." },
    { "id": "note-3", "page": "page-1", "x": 0, "y": 880, "w": 520, "text": "Chat is the product. Two live timers sit in the header so the absurd context is never off-screen. Prompts appear only after 40s of silence, and can be switched off." },
    { "id": "note-4", "page": "page-1", "x": 0, "y": 1880, "w": 520, "text": "SECONDARY — anonymous stats and the global board. Deliberately not a social profile: no photo, no followers, no bio, and a one-tap new identity." },
    { "id": "note-5", "page": "page-2", "x": 0, "y": -150, "w": 860, "text": "Two alternate directions, low-fi. B trades the joke for clinical restraint; C goes full meme-poster — louder screenshots, harder to live in day to day. Say the word and I'll rebuild the journey in either." }
  ],
